{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/57f3a780e72535b7f0e34b8ec495602d.webp?t=1764349256\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/59e89dfd358b86ef6611333f953c6c2f.avif?t=1764349256\" width=577 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There once was Elise, a vibrant and ambitious young lass with a big dream \u2013 <strong>becoming filthy rich. </strong>Alas, the stars didn\u2019t seem to reserve much fortune for our protagonist. Elise, who came from humble beginnings, had no choice but to spend her days assisting her fellow neighbours with menial tasks to make a living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Elise discovers a pair of beautiful, shiny red shoes buried in her backyard \u2013 what a surprise! Bewitched, she embarks on a fearful journey that draws her ever closer into the heart of the mysterious Woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Elise risk it all for the sake of a dream come true, or settle for her humble day-to-day life? The ending of this tale is yours to write\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/5c7b70e61916dcef56f06deaa80bf50d.poster.avif?t=1764349256\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/5c7b70e61916dcef56f06deaa80bf50d.webm?t=1764349256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/5c7b70e61916dcef56f06deaa80bf50d.mp4?t=1764349256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/da73e2cd96a757cef45d49a9dc046b08.avif?t=1764349256\" width=598 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Goody Two Shoes is a horror narrative adventure game, set in a hand-painted fairy tale environment. There are 10 possible endings to fit your choices and actions in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there\u2019s more than meets the eye here, as you must also manage multiple aspects of Elise\u2019s life in the village to stay alive. Remember, all decisions matter in this story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, you will need to strengthen Elise\u2019s bonds with her fellow villagers and work to make a living by playing fun minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But once the moon rises, make sure to keep Elise fed, healthy and sane in the multiple encounters with deadly foes as she makes her way further into the Woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/c017bf8bcfccb54a2cae6a28c23535c8.poster.avif?t=1764349256\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/c017bf8bcfccb54a2cae6a28c23535c8.webm?t=1764349256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/c017bf8bcfccb54a2cae6a28c23535c8.mp4?t=1764349256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/7fcad4218a01177a5578df5e227010ca.avif?t=1764349256\" width=613 height=134 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kieferberg is a small and devout village, which means Elise will need to carefully navigate her relationships with the villagers to avoid arousing suspicion of witchcraft and be left to die in the Woods as punishment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, Elise can roam around the Woodlands, a mystical and phantasmagorical  realm where enigmas and deadly enemies await as she tries to uncover its secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a limited day and night cycle Elise will need to carefully manage her needs if she wants to stay alive to finish her tale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get struck by Cupid\u2019s arrow and fall in love with the charming bachelorettes of Kieferberg. In this all-female cast of romanceable characters, unlock dreamy date scenes and storylines for each of them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/bc492cfe4364fe740e5eaf9cb7828ee2.avif?t=1764349256\" width=616 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/57f3a780e72535b7f0e34b8ec495602d.webp?t=1764349256\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":" Fated Encounter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1812370/9e16a92bf114627fe2a86b25a67849764f68a65f.jpg"},{"name":" An Old Hag's Tale","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1812370/f913a0220030fa353264b700342b4d3b1a7af368.jpg"},{"name":" Carrier of Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1812370/a7290e0ffb23c7641c4de1276405e1c54475c71b.jpg"},{"name":" Sigil of the Crow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1812370/29dc55ec241ca0d00e1608d076c558cd2579c79d.jpg"},{"name":" Mari Lwyd","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1812370/011fa5de2316d4b86d758579475cd08aa11057e1.jpg"},{"name":" Broken Shackles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1812370/df94a7a246b3d311907711595ed2680bff80cc23.jpg"},{"name":" The Tender Flesh","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1812370/2c6cdca8f9d5d46c47572b478b28a38047b0e1ff.jpg"},{"name":" Sigil of the Serpent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1812370/9f1bd5e9f6cd5ff4589e3ae5abf6eeaeb3e2324d.jpg"},{"name":" All Eyes on Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1812370/162f6959ad5fdc99545741c18ea7d5601af6eee2.jpg"},{"name":" Sunken Aventesma","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1812370/81baf5a9a6fea34e7758f34d1ef1917e426cbfc7.jpg"}],"total":40},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1812370?t=1764349256","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1812370?t=1764349256","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/ce4bb59b7ba99a399ecff5eacaaa170fec7345ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764349256","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/ce4bb59b7ba99a399ecff5eacaaa170fec7345ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764349256","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2614400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Dreaming Maidens: Pocket Mirror x Little Goody Two Shoes</h1><p>In these narrative-driven horror adventure games, you will find yourself using your wits to solve puzzles and explore rich environments full of charm and wonder. <br><br>Your choices will determine your fate - try to discover as many endings as you can to uncover the truths to mysteries long forgotten!<br><br>This bundle contains:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pocket Mirror ~ GoldenerTraum: a modern RPG puzzle horror game that will have you playing as a young girl who, deprived of her memories, finds herself embarking on a dreamy and frightening journey of self-discovery.<br></li><li>Little Goody Two Shoes: a fairy tale horror adventure game with a dark twist. Follow Elise, an ambitious girl determined to become rich, as she attempts to escape her humble life and finds herself getting more than she bargained for\u2026</li></ul></p><br><h1>Little Goody Two Shoes Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/8ebfb54e1cc1693e2bcbd8b417665b56.avif?t=1764349256\" width=1414 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take Little Goody Two Shoes\u2019 music anywhere you go with the Deluxe Edition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This bundle contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Goody Two Shoes - a fairy tale horror adventure game with a dark twist. Follow Elise, an ambitious girl determined to become rich and escape her humble life in the village of Kieferberg.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official Soundtrack - The official soundtrack for Little Goody Two Shoes features 64 all-original tracks from the main game, including 3 unreleased bonus tracks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Art of Little Goody Two Shoes \u2013 Official Game Artbook - 600+ pages of character design, map and environment artwork, animation storyboards, sprite art, etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>PLAY THE DEMO NOW!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/5e3031440b953d6a212e176c815fa63b.avif?t=1764349256\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br>Try the demo today and enjoy the starting section of the game, where you explore Kieferberg and its mysteries, romance its bachelorettes and get a taste of the terrors of the Witching Hour...</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/57f3a780e72535b7f0e34b8ec495602d.webp?t=1764349256\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/59e89dfd358b86ef6611333f953c6c2f.avif?t=1764349256\" width=577 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There once was Elise, a vibrant and ambitious young lass with a big dream \u2013 <strong>becoming filthy rich. </strong>Alas, the stars didn\u2019t seem to reserve much fortune for our protagonist. Elise, who came from humble beginnings, had no choice but to spend her days assisting her fellow neighbours with menial tasks to make a living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Elise discovers a pair of beautiful, shiny red shoes buried in her backyard \u2013 what a surprise! Bewitched, she embarks on a fearful journey that draws her ever closer into the heart of the mysterious Woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Elise risk it all for the sake of a dream come true, or settle for her humble day-to-day life? The ending of this tale is yours to write\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/5c7b70e61916dcef56f06deaa80bf50d.poster.avif?t=1764349256\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/5c7b70e61916dcef56f06deaa80bf50d.webm?t=1764349256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/5c7b70e61916dcef56f06deaa80bf50d.mp4?t=1764349256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/da73e2cd96a757cef45d49a9dc046b08.avif?t=1764349256\" width=598 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Goody Two Shoes is a horror narrative adventure game, set in a hand-painted fairy tale environment. There are 10 possible endings to fit your choices and actions in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there\u2019s more than meets the eye here, as you must also manage multiple aspects of Elise\u2019s life in the village to stay alive. Remember, all decisions matter in this story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, you will need to strengthen Elise\u2019s bonds with her fellow villagers and work to make a living by playing fun minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But once the moon rises, make sure to keep Elise fed, healthy and sane in the multiple encounters with deadly foes as she makes her way further into the Woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/c017bf8bcfccb54a2cae6a28c23535c8.poster.avif?t=1764349256\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/c017bf8bcfccb54a2cae6a28c23535c8.webm?t=1764349256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/c017bf8bcfccb54a2cae6a28c23535c8.mp4?t=1764349256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/7fcad4218a01177a5578df5e227010ca.avif?t=1764349256\" width=613 height=134 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kieferberg is a small and devout village, which means Elise will need to carefully navigate her relationships with the villagers to avoid arousing suspicion of witchcraft and be left to die in the Woods as punishment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, Elise can roam around the Woodlands, a mystical and phantasmagorical  realm where enigmas and deadly enemies await as she tries to uncover its secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a limited day and night cycle Elise will need to carefully manage her needs if she wants to stay alive to finish her tale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get struck by Cupid\u2019s arrow and fall in love with the charming bachelorettes of Kieferberg. In this all-female cast of romanceable characters, unlock dreamy date scenes and storylines for each of them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/bc492cfe4364fe740e5eaf9cb7828ee2.avif?t=1764349256\" width=616 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/extras/57f3a780e72535b7f0e34b8ec495602d.webp?t=1764349256\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p>","developers":["AstralShift"],"dlc":[2645050,4132560],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1812370/header.jpg?t=1764349256","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2023 AstralShiftPro LDA. All rights reserved. Published by Square Enix Limited. Developed by AstralShiftPro, LDA.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1812370/620797/494668a577fe68712291bd2870662da7a58070b4/1750737736/dash_av1.mpd?t=1698746227","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1812370/620797/494668a577fe68712291bd2870662da7a58070b4/1750737736/dash_h264.mpd?t=1698746227","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1812370/620797/494668a577fe68712291bd2870662da7a58070b4/1750737736/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1698746227","id":256977111,"name":"PEGI EN Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256977111/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1698746227"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1812370/616288/df000c9d6504103091c4bdbb86bcb8561afe4dd3/1750737712/da